### 5. User Interface Review 🔧 **NEEDS MINOR FIX**

#### 5.1 Bulk Edit Page ⚠️ **TEXT FIELD INCONSISTENCY**

**Issue Identified:** Input field styling inconsistency in bulk edit table

**Current Implementation** (Lines 273-284):
```php
<td class="col-seo-title">
  <input 
    type="text" 
    name="seo_title[<?php echo esc_attr($post_id); ?>]" 
    value="<?php echo esc_attr($seo_title); ?>" 
    placeholder="<?php esc_attr_e('Leave blank for auto-generated title', 'asneris-seo-toolkit'); ?>"
  >
</td>
<td class="col-description">
  <textarea 
    name="seo_description[<?php echo esc_attr($post_id); ?>]" 
    rows="3" 
    placeholder="<?php esc_attr_e('Leave blank for auto-generated description', 'asneris-seo-toolkit'); ?>"
  ><?php echo esc_textarea($seo_desc); ?></textarea>
</td>
```

**CSS Styling** (Lines 46-47):
```css
#ASNERISSEO-bulk-edit-table input[type="text"],
#ASNERISSEO-bulk-edit-table textarea,
#ASNERISSEO-bulk-edit-table select {
  width:100%;
  box-sizing:border-box;
  padding:8px 10px;     /* ✅ Consistent padding */
  font-size:13px;       /* ✅ Consistent font size */
  line-height:1.4;      /* ⚠️ May cause height differences */
  border:1px solid #ddd;
  border-radius:4px;
}
```

**Problem Analysis:**
1. **Input Field (`<input type="text">`):**
   - Single-line height
   - `line-height: 1.4` creates ~18px line box
   - Total height: padding (16px) + line (18px) + borders (2px) = **36px**

2. **Textarea Field (`<textarea rows="3">`):**
   - Multi-line with `rows="3"`
   - Same padding and line-height
   - Total height: padding (16px) + (3 * 18px lines) + borders (2px) = **72px**
   - `min-height: 60px` override in CSS

3. **Select Field (`<select>`):**
   - Browser default height varies
   - May not align with input fields

**Visual Impact:**
- Text input appears smaller/shorter than textarea
- Select dropdown may be different height
- Placeholder text may wrap differently
- Overall table appears unbalanced

**Recommended Fix:**

**Option A: Standardize Input Heights**
```css
/* Add explicit heights for consistency */
#ASNERISSEO-bulk-edit-table input[type="text"] {
  height: 40px; /* Fixed height for single-line inputs */
  line-height: 1.5; /* Better vertical centering */
}

#ASNERISSEO-bulk-edit-table select {
  height: 40px; /* Match input height */
  line-height: 1.5;
}

#ASNERISSEO-bulk-edit-table textarea {
  min-height: 80px; /* Taller for better visibility */
  line-height: 1.5; /* Consistent with inputs */
}
```

**Option B: Use WordPress Default Styles**
```css
/* Inherit WordPress admin form styles */
#ASNERISSEO-bulk-edit-table input[type="text"],
#ASNERISSEO-bulk-edit-table select {
  padding: 0 8px;
  line-height: 2; /* WordPress default: 28px height */
  min-height: 30px; /* WordPress default */
}

#ASNERISSEO-bulk-edit-table textarea {
  padding: 2px 6px; /* WordPress textarea default */
  line-height: 1.4;
  min-height: 80px;
}
```

**Recommended:** Option B (WordPress consistency)  
**Time to Fix:** 5-10 minutes  
**Priority:** 🟡 MEDIUM (visual polish, not functional)

