  box-sizing:border-box;
  padding:8px 10px;
  font-size:13px;
  line-height:1.4;
  border:1px solid #ddd;
  border-radius:4px;
}
```

**Recommended Fix:**
```css
/* Standardize input heights for visual consistency */
#ASNERISSEO-bulk-edit-table input[type="text"],
#ASNERISSEO-bulk-edit-table select {
  padding: 0 8px;
  line-height: 2; /* 28px height - WordPress standard */
  min-height: 30px;
  font-size: 14px; /* Match WordPress admin */
}

#ASNERISSEO-bulk-edit-table textarea {
  padding: 2px 6px; /* WordPress textarea default */
  line-height: 1.4;
  min-height: 80px; /* Taller for better readability */
  font-size: 14px;
}
```

**Testing:**
1. Open bulk edit page
2. Verify input fields align properly
3. Check textarea has sufficient height
4. Test on mobile (responsive behavior)

### 🟢 MEDIUM PRIORITY (Nice to Have)

#### 2. Remove Development Cache Busting
**File:** `includes/class-bulk-edit.php`  
**Line:** 27  
**Time:** 1 minute

**Current:**
```php
$version = ASNERISSEO_VERSION . '.' . time(); // Development
```

**Production:**
```php
$version = ASNERISSEO_VERSION; // Production-ready
```

**Impact:** Reduces unnecessary cache invalidation in production

#### 3. Add ARIA Labels to Icon-Only Buttons
**File:** `includes/class-bulk-edit.php`  
