```php
<a href="<?php echo esc_url(get_edit_post_link($post_id)); ?>" 
   class="button button-small ASNERISSEO-edit-post-link" 
   aria-label="<?php esc_attr_e('Edit post in WordPress editor', 'asneris-seo-toolkit'); ?>"
   title="<?php esc_attr_e('Edit full post in WordPress editor', 'asneris-seo-toolkit'); ?>" 
   target="_blank">
  <span class="dashicons dashicons-external" aria-hidden="true"></span>
</a>
```

**Impact:** Improves screen reader accessibility (WCAG AAA)

