## ✅ Final Recommendations

### Immediate Actions (Before WordPress.org Submission)

1. **Fix Bulk Edit UI Consistency** (10 minutes)
   - Update CSS for standardized input/textarea/select heights
   - Test on bulk edit page
   - Verify mobile responsiveness

2. **Remove Development Cache Busting** (1 minute)
   - Change `$version = ASNERISSEO_VERSION . '.' . time();`
   - To `$version = ASNERISSEO_VERSION;`
   - Apply to all enqueue functions

3. **Final Testing Round** (30 minutes)
   - Test bulk edit on all 3 Docker environments
   - Verify help modals work on all pages
   - Check mobile responsiveness
   - Test with WordPress 5.8, 6.1, and Latest

4. **Create Final Package** (5 minutes)
   - Run `npm run build` for production assets
   - Execute `create-wordpress-org-package.ps1`
   - Verify ZIP contents

